      "title": "doxygen: Fix macro expansion for variadic C functions",
      "message": "doxygen: Fix macro expansion for variadic C functions\n\nSome content is hard to read since the macros are going into a\nrecursive process and the final documentation is partly\nright-aligned, with some parts missing.\n\nEnable the functionality and add the known guilty macro to the\nlist.\n",
